dialect protocol
protocol json.diff
version 1
schema stdio.json
start record

# P2-P1: REAL binary diff frame, replacing F6's `print_diff().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut
# (`🔣️json/…/🔺️diff/🦀️.rs`'s old `DiffCodec::encode_diff` — per the P2-W0 census, 100% of
# stdio's `DiffCodec` impls were still on this shortcut; this is the first real upgrade). Same
# structural reasoning as the sibling `../../🧬️mutations/💾️binary/📡️.protocol.semio` (read
# that file's comment for the full `DslField`/recursion rationale — it applies identically here,
# `JsonValueDiff` is the diff-shaped twin of the same recursive `JsonValue`/collection-triple
# problem): `format u8` + `has_value u8` (0 = `JsonDiff{value:None}`, i.e. no change; 1 = present) as
# two real fixed fields, then the recursive `JsonValueDiff` payload (when present) as one opaque
# trailing `bytes` chain — real LEB128-varint-framed binary (`enc_value_diff_bin`/`dec_value_diff_bin`
# in the same `🦀️.rs`), honestly opaque at THIS layer for the identical `Prim::Ref`
# protocol-recursion gap documented in the mutations sibling file (filed once, in this wave's
# `mechanism_gaps`, applies to both facets).
framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field has_value u8
chain payload bytes
